      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://genealogytrails.com/mich/lenawee/citypalmyra.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Palmyra has been a key trading and shipping point for farmers, thanks to its location on the Michigan Southern railroad and the Toledo & Western electric line.",
